{
  "$comment": [
    "How doan onboarding commands with --json turn an app-socket v2 reply into the public cli-envelope v1. Transport v2 and envelope v1 are separate versions.",
    "1. A v2 success becomes {v: 1, ok: true, result} with the reply's result unchanged, exit 0.",
    "2. Exception: for check, sign_in, project_inspect, project_select, project_clone and complete, when the reply's own operation is already failed, the envelope fails with that operation's error.code; when it is already cancelled, with code cancelled. cancel reports its target and status reports every operation as data, so both stay ok: true.",
    "3. A v2 error keeps its code, except bad_request -> internal_error (the CLI sent a schema-valid request) and bad_token -> app_not_running (a stale runtime.json, as for active).",
    "4. A reply with numeric v other than 2, including an older app's v1 bad_request, is app_protocol_mismatch.",
    "5. exitCodes gives the exit for every code a command can return; a code missing from it exits 1.",
    "Codes produced by the CLI before or without a reply: usage_error (bad flags, a Copilot check without --spend-copilot-request), app_not_running, app_launch_failed (the bundled app did not publish a runtime within 15 seconds), internal_error."
  ],
  "translate": {
    "bad_request": "internal_error",
    "bad_token": "app_not_running"
  },
  "exitCodes": {
    "internal_error": 1,
    "usage_error": 2,
    "invalid_url": 2,
    "path_unavailable": 2,
    "not_candidate": 2,
    "initialize_required": 2,
    "request_conflict": 2,
    "operation_not_found": 2,
    "inspection_stale": 2,
    "destination_exists": 2,
    "app_not_running": 3,
    "app_protocol_mismatch": 3,
    "app_launch_failed": 3,
    "session_stale": 3,
    "busy": 5,
    "stop_required": 5,
    "not_owner": 5,
    "not_connected": 5,
    "sign_out_failed": 5,
    "auth_unavailable": 5,
    "no_ready_agent": 5,
    "no_project": 5,
    "cancelled": 5,
    "sign_in_failed": 5,
    "network": 5,
    "storage_failed": 5,
    "check_failed": 5,
    "account_mismatch": 5,
    "cli_install_failed": 5,
    "repository_unreachable": 5,
    "git_missing": 5,
    "remote_mismatch": 5,
    "clone_failed": 5,
    "cleanup_failed": 5,
    "config_invalid": 5,
    "init_failed": 5,
    "project_unavailable": 5,
    "completion_save_failed": 5,
    "completion_unsupported_version": 5
  },
  "cases": [
